{#- Completion-style chat template for base models without a chat format (e.g. GPT-2).

Renders each message's content verbatim with no wrapping, so a single user message
becomes the raw prompt text and generated completions continue it. Preference-pair
training on raw-continuation data (the DPO paper's IMDb setup) uses this template.
-#}
{%- for message in messages %}{{ message['content'] }}{%- endfor %}
